      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "update: I fixed the problem\n\nSooo basically I noticed 3 tasks shown under Task Manager while the game was in a non responding state. vrchat, conhost and DriverInfo.\n\nOn my other machines none of them were listed. So I assumed it must be one of these that hung up.\n\nSo I just deleted that one as it timed out after 10-20 minutes anyway.\nsteamgames/...../VRChat/VRChat_Data/StreamingAssets/DriverInfo/DriverInfo.exe\n\nNow the game immediately starts",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
