  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-23T17:41:03.890Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I wanted to put vrchat on my Laptop to show it my family. However All I get is a white screen, the application is not responding and there's pretty much zero hardware usage going on.\n\nI updated system, gpu drivers, verified the files and tried it in vr and desktop mode.\n\nHardware wise it's an Aorus X5 v4:\n\ngpu: 2x GTX 965m (4GB GDDR5 + gsync)\nram: 16GB DDR3\ncpu: i7 5700HQ\nstorage: 1TB SSD Raid 0, 1TB HDD\nSystem: win10 1803\n\nI already tried to disable sli and gsync.\nI also tried to run it as admin",
